Video objects that were created but never successfully given bytes
==============================================================================
{GUID_NEVER_UPLOADED}  created, no upload attempted        -> status 0, zero webhooks, indefinitely
{GUID_FETCH_404}       created, POST .../fetch on a 404 URL -> status 0, zero webhooks, indefinitely
{GUID_TUS_ABANDONED}   created, TUS upload started then abandoned mid-transfer -> status 0, zero webhooks

  The fetch call answered synchronously and never went asynchronous:
    HTTP 422  {"success":false,"message":"Origin returned HTTP 404 (Not Found).","statusCode":422}

  All three were still status 0 with empty transcodingMessages when the capture ended.
  No webhook of any Status was ever delivered for any of them -- so the Status=0 POST
  fires on upload, not on creation.
